# Company OS rules

- Treat `docs/company-os/` as durable project memory for Meridian Land + Southcrest Management work.
- When the user locks a decision or changes vision, data model, Drive taxonomy, systems, or roadmap, update the relevant files under `docs/company-os/` before finishing.
- Do not rely on chat history alone for long-term continuity.
- Default to discussion/spec unless the user asks to implement.
- Foundation order: Project Master / identity → Drive discipline → email triage (shadow) → clean DB / Procore blend → role agents → personal employee agents.
- Owner Assistant (Mark only) is an allowed parallel Phase 0.5 track. It does not skip human-gated rules and is not a rollout of employee agents. Follow `docs/company-os/OWNER_ASSISTANT.md`.
- Do not propose client-rooted project folder structures as the primary Drive model.
- Prefer human-gated, shadow-mode automation over unsupervised outbound actions.
